    'The workflow: (1) take a Heap Snapshot (baseline); (2) perform the suspect action 5-10×; (3) take another snapshot; (4) compare — the "Objects allocated between" filter shows what grew. The RETAINER CHAIN (who holds the reference?) is the key — it shows the exact path from the GC root to the leaked object.',
