    'The common retainer patterns: a closure capturing a large object (the event handler that captures the store); a detached DOM tree (a variable holding a removed element — the element + its children are alive); an event listener on a REMOVED element (the listener keeps the element alive); a growing array/Map without eviction (the cache that never clears).',
