    'O — Open/Closed: open for EXTENSION, closed for MODIFICATION. Add new behavior by ADDING code (a new strategy, a new plugin), not by EDITING existing code (strategy-pattern). The test: adding a feature touches only NEW files (or adds a case to a factory).',
